step Everlook: Zippie Fizzbolt
  zone Winterspring
  tip Zippie Fizzbolt, Everlook's quartermaster. Friendly, level 50 gear: Steamwheedle Grips 3g 10s (Spirit, Intellect), Impractical Headwarmer 5g 84s (Agility, Stamina, frost resistance), Substandard Belt Chain 4g 68s (Agility, attack power), Coldmetal Guard, a chest, 10g 96s (Strength, Stamina). Honored, three trinkets at about 7g 55s: Everlook Pathcarver (nature resistance), Everlook Delivery Bot (frost resistance) and Parachute-Priest Pager (shadow resistance), the last two with a use. Revered: Fizzbolt's Fashionable Fedora, 25g.
