step Powderfuse: Friz Frazzlespark
  zone Riverglades
  tip Friz Frazzlespark sells Powderfuse's rewards in Powderfuse Port, on the east coast of the Riverglades, alongside general goods. Friendly, level 40 gear: Crawler's Clackers 2g 74s (Stamina, attack power), Misplaced Pantaloons 2g 94s (Intellect, Spirit), Disengagement Ring 2g 36s (Agility, Spirit). Honored: Primitive Fishing Pole, a two-handed weapon, 9g 46s (Stamina, Strength, Agility); Thrash's Trash, a shield, 3g 80s (Stamina, spell damage, healing). Revered: Haughty Fellow's Monocle, 10g.
